  "html": "<p>This is an assortment of different types of monsters who all share the feature of being strange and unusual creatures with magic powers of different types.  They also appear to share some of the same strengths and weaknesses, and therefore fit into this rather eclectic category.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 3 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Demi-Humans\" title=\"Category:Demi-Humans\">Demi-Humans</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Demons\" title=\"Category:Demons\">Demons</a></li></ul><h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Revenants\" title=\"Category:Revenants\">Revenants</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Demonspawn\"</h2>\n<p>There are 79 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>1</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/1/2_Blade\" title=\"1/2 Blade\">1/2 Blade</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/1/2_Slacker\" title=\"1/2 Slacker\">1/2 Slacker</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Family\" title=\"Abaddon's Family\">Abaddon's Family</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Guard_%28Caster%29\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard (Caster)\">Abaddon's Guard (Caster)</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon's_Guard_%28Melee%29\" title=\"Abaddon's Guard (Melee)\">Abaddon's Guard (Melee)</a></span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Angel</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Felknight\" title=\"Arctic Felknight\">Arctic Felknight</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack\" title=\"Balzack\">Balzack</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Spawn\" ti